{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op horror survival game for 1\u20134 players, you must search for a way to escape, solve deadly puzzles, and hide from a relentless spirit. Now you have a new way to fight back against the terrifying force \u2014 use your voice. With the microphone, you can banish Slendrina with words and interact with objects, unlocking new opportunities for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember: every word you speak can become either the key to survival or the cause of your death. Slendrina hears everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/9a304f930a9f4207d895aa4ffb08a4ef.webp?t=1759656157\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interact with the world using your microphone, speaking words to increase your chances of survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.poster.avif?t=1759656157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.webm?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/50d8b9a788ddbc99df4c9de9762d3202.mp4?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/8cf9c8d3c0b7883b4e947bbbb1f809f9.webp?t=1759656157\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden paths and explore dark corridors. Your strategy and attentiveness will determine whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/adb7c74187ad4c5fe2b8fc10ee89d52f.poster.avif?t=1759656157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/adb7c74187ad4c5fe2b8fc10ee89d52f.webm?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/adb7c74187ad4c5fe2b8fc10ee89d52f.mp4?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/58e2f66474013104ec4c506f841ee638.webp?t=1759656157\" width=616 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is unpredictable. Sometimes she waits, sometimes she strikes without warning. Every session brings a new threat you can't prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.poster.avif?t=1759656157\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.webm?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344520/extras/71a09ce7a30534f2c4b63a89456a8391.mp4?t=1759656157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart Slendrina, or will you remain trapped forever?</p>","background":"https://st